<view class="prototype-page notifications-page">
  <subpage-header/>
  <view class="prototype-title page-title">消息提醒</view>
  <view class="page-caption">管理饭桌与想念的微信提醒。</view>
  <view class="prototype-card subscribe-card {{canSupplement?'':'subscribe-card-closed'}}" bindtap="subscribe"><view><view class="subscribe-title">{{authorizing?'正在补充提醒…':'一键补充全部'}}</view><text>{{templateHint}}</text><text wx:if="{{creditHint}}">{{creditHint}}</text></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
  <block wx:for="{{reminderGroups}}" wx:key="title">
    <view class="section-head"><text>{{item.title}}</text></view>
    <view class="reminder-group">
      <view wx:for="{{item.rows}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="event" class="reminder-row">
        <view class="reminder-head">
          <view>{{row.label}}</view>
          <switch checked="{{row.enabled}}" color="#42664f" disabled="{{savingPreference || authorizing || testingEvent}}" data-event="{{row.event}}" bindchange="preference"/>
        </view>
        <view class="reminder-meta">
          <text class="reminder-count">{{row.templateId?'预计可用 '+row.count+' 次 / '+row.max+' 次':'微信模板暂未配置，站内功能照常可用'}}</text>
          <button wx:if="{{row.templateId && row.enabled && row.count<row.max}}" class="reminder-add" data-event="{{row.event}}" bindtap="subscribe" disabled="{{authorizing || testingEvent || savingPreference}}">单独补充</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{testConfigured}}" class="prototype-card test-card">
    <view class="test-heading">测试微信提醒</view>
    <view class="test-caption">发送给当前登录的微信账号；每次测试会消耗对应模板的一次提醒机会。没有机会时，点击后会先申请该模板授权。</view>
    <view class="test-actions">
      <button wx:for="{{testEvents}}" wx:key="event" class="test-button" data-event="{{item.event}}" bindtap="sendTest" loading="{{testingEvent===item.event}}" disabled="{{!testReady || testingEvent || authorizing || savingPreference}}">{{item.label}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="test-caption">“已请求发送”表示微信接口已接受请求，不代表消息一定已送达或已读。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-head"><text>饭桌消息</text><text wx:if="{{unreadCount}}" bindtap="markRead">全部标为已读</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在看看有什么新消息…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="prototype-card state"><view>{{error}}</view><button bindtap="load">重新试试</button></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!items.length}}" class="prototype-card state">还没有新消息，一起点一顿饭吧。</view>
  <view wx:else class="prototype-card message-list">
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="message-item" data-id="{{item.orderId}}" bindtap="openOrder">
      <view class="message-dot {{item.readAt?'read':''}}"/>
      <view class="message-copy"><view>{{item.title}}</view><text>{{item.content}}</text><text class="message-time">{{item.createdAt}} · {{item.readAt?'已读':'未读'}}</text>
      <view class="readers"><view wx:for="{{item.readers}}" wx:for-item="reader" wx:key="id" class="reader"><view class="reader-avatar {{reader.readAt?'has-read':''}}"><image wx:if="{{reader.avatarUrl}}" src="{{reader.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>{{reader.initial}}</text><text wx:if="{{reader.readAt}}" class="read-check">✓</text></view><text class="reader-status">{{reader.nickname}} · {{reader.status}}</text></view></view></view>
      <text class="chevron">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="tip">预计次数按本小程序记录，微信不提供准确余额。每类最多保留10次；满额后会跳过该模板的授权申请，发送消耗后可再次补充。头像上的绿色对勾表示已在小程序内阅读；历史消息缺少双方关联时显示“无阅读记录”。微信通知是否被阅读无法判断。</view>
</view>
